  "intro": {
    "title": "Im Haus, ins Haus",
    "paragraphs": [
      "In is a two-way preposition: dative for where something is (im Kino, in the cinema), accusative for where it's going (ins Kino, to the cinema). It also covers months, seasons and years: im Mai, im Sommer."
    ]
  },
